dule__ (PY6d's REQUEST): a module's function's module, a builtin's"] [213 2 "// \"builtins\", else None (pickle's whichmodule then finds the function in sys.modules)"] [214 2 "// a built-in method named like a slot (a generator's __next__) has the slot wrapper's doc (typeobject.c's slotdefs)"] [238 2 "// methodobject.c's meth_reduce (PY6d's REQUEST: pickle saves a built-in function by name): a function's"] [239 2 "// qualified name, a bound method as getattr(self, name)"] [249 3 "// a built-in type's static method (METH_STATIC: m_self the type, __self__ None) and tp_new's wrapper are"] [250 3 "// getattr(type, name) too (str.maketrans, object.__new__: test_pickle's test_c_methods and complex_newobj_ex)"] [263 3 "// CPython's \"at 0x...\", the address an identity number (asyncio's Handle reprs and their tests: PY6h's"] [264 3 "// REQUEST, queue 200)"] [273 2 "// cell([contents]): Objects/cellobject.c's cell_new, cell_repr and cell_richcompare (queue 205f: annotationlib's"] [274 2 "// _build_closure makes the stringifiers' cells)"] [295 35 "// tp_richcompare without tp_hash: hash() refuses a cell"] [305 3 "// empty cells come before anything else (cell_compare_impl)"] [331 3 "// module_repr: importlib's _module_repr once importlib is the import system (PY6b's request)"] [337 4 "// importlib's _module_repr: a module with a location is \"from\" it"] [342 2 "// module(name, doc=None), CPython's module_init; a subclass's instance (queue 205: six's _MovedItems) made empty"] [343 2 "// as new_module makes it, its __init__ (module.__init__ through super()) filling it"] [366 2 "// module_new: an uninitialized module (its dict empty), any arguments; module_init fills it"] [382 2 "// module_getsets: __annotations__ and __annotate__ (PEP 649), data descriptors before the dict"] [387 38 "// a subclass's instance: its class's data descriptors first"] [413 2 "// module.__dir__ (module_dir, queue 223: traceback's suggestions call it): the dict's __dir__ function called,"] [414 2 "//